        "created_at": "2015-01-10T03:23:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yep, as long as you use the other power first (Including Micro-Assembler, Rod of Anubis, Idol of Anput) you still get to use Strke Twice that turn.</p><p>If you strike first, then you don't have a power to use other than the second Strike Overdrive grants you.</p>",
